{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21205","headline":"和乐天赠吴丹 · 元稹","name":"和乐天赠吴丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不识吴生面，久知吴生道。\n迹虽染世名，心本奉天老。\n雌一守命门，廻九填血脑。\n委气荣卫和，咽津颜色好。\n传闻共甲子，衰隤尽枯[槁]。\n独有冰雪容，纤华夺鲜缟。\n问人何能尔，吴实旷怀抱。\n弁冕徒挂身，身外非所宝。\n伊予固童昧，希真亦云早。\n石坛玉晨尊，昼夜长自埽。\n密印视丹田，游神梦三岛。\n万过黄庭经，一食青精稻。\n冥搜方朔桃，结念安期枣。\n绿发幸未改，丹诚自能保。\n行当摆尘缨，吴门事探讨。\n君爲先此词，终期搴瑶草。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21205.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21205","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}